    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        40,
        -510
      ],
      "size": [
        1040,
        510
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LTX 2.5 Union Control \u2014 Depth\n\n1. Install WeeTodd Nodes and restart ComfyUI.\n2. Accept the model licenses and place the LTX 2.5 split components under `ComfyUI/models/` or a shared root from `extra_model_paths.yaml`.\n3. Download Union Control into `ComfyUI/models/loras/`, then follow the README baked-Q8 command.\n4. Download the Apache-2.0 Video Depth Anything Small checkpoint and run the README conversion command once.\n5. Select a 121-frame source movie. Leave workflow video paths empty when sharing.\n6. **Video Depth Preprocessor (MLX)** creates the frame-aligned temporal depth guide and unloads its model before LTX sampling.\n7. Describe the target appearance and sound while asking the model to preserve the guide motion and geometry.\n8. Queue the workflow after **LTX 2.5 Preflight** succeeds.\n\nThis balanced workflow uses the official two-stage recipe: eight controlled low-resolution evaluations and three clean full-resolution refinements. The `ref0.5` adapter requires final dimensions divisible by 128; 768\u00d7512 is the default. The baked checkpoint is self-describing. Do not connect a separate IC-LoRA Loader.\n\n### Downloads\n\n- [LTX 2.5 model components](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5)\n- [LTX 2.3 22B Union Control IC-LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Union-Control)\n- [Video Depth Anything Small](https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/Video-Depth-Anything-Small)\n\n### Baked Q8 setup\n\n`$COMFYUI_ROOT/.venv/bin/python $COMFYUI_ROOT/custom_nodes/WeeTodd-Nodes/scripts/fuse_ltx25_paged_lora.py $COMFYUI_ROOT/models/diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-q8-paged $COMFYUI_ROOT/models/loras/ltx-2.3-22b-ic-lora-union-control-ref0.5.safetensors $COMFYUI_ROOT/models/diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-union1p0-q8-paged --strength 1.0`\n\n### One-time MLX depth conversion\n\n`$COMFYUI_ROOT/.venv/bin/python $COMFYUI_ROOT/custom_nodes/WeeTodd-Nodes/scripts/convert_video_depth_anything_mlx.py $COMFYUI_ROOT/models/annotators/video_depth_anything/video_depth_anything_vits.pth $COMFYUI_ROOT/models/annotators/video_depth_anything/video_depth_anything_vits_mlx.safetensors`"
      ],
      "title": "Setup and model downloads",
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#15202b"
    }
